OL,3,GNEWSAFlag injunction would 'silence
OL,4,Apolitical views'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lawyer representing the co-founder of
OL,7,Fthe anti-migrant group Raise the
OL,8,FColours has told a court that putting
OL,9,Fup flags is an expression of his
OL,10,Fpolitical views that should be
OL,11,Fprotected by the European Convention on
OL,12,FHuman Rights.
OL,14,FThe submission was made at the High
OL,15,FCourt on Monday, as Birmingham City
OL,16,FCouncil sought an injunction preventing
OL,17,FRyan Bridge and his group from
OL,18,Fattaching flags and other items to
OL,19,Fpublic property.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
