OL,3,GNEWSAFlag injunction would 'silence
OL,4,Apolitical views'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority has argued their actions
OL,7,Fcaused danger, alarm and distress, and
OL,8,Fan injunction is needed to prevent
OL,9,Ffurther incidents.
OL,11,FAt the end of the hearing, Judge Emma
OL,12,FKelly reserved judgement and said her
OL,13,Fruling would be issued in the coming
OL,14,Fdays.
